    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Digital Realty Trust, Inc. is a public company headquartered in Austin, Texas, trading under the ticker DLR. Its website describes the company as delivering the world's largest data center platform, offering data center services, colocation, connectivity, and cloud services across a global ecosystem. The company says its platform supports deployments from single racks to private suites and high-density AI workflows, and that it is sustainably built for flexibility, open ecosystems, and reach.\n\nOn AI, the site states that AI is exposing infrastructure gaps, with inference loads and GPU demands pushing traditional environments to their limits. It promotes the 2026 Global Data Insights Survey, noting that 40% of IT leaders cite infrastructure as an AI constraint and that enterprises are moving from AI strategy to execution. The company positions its data center and interconnection capabilities as a response to these AI infrastructure demands.\n\nThe company's SEC CIK number is 0001297996, and its legal exposure includes 126 entries in Texas.",
